99	     * repeats with the same key returns the originally created owner (200) instead of creating a
100	     * duplicate. Keyed by the raw header value; the mapped value is the created owner's id.
101	     */
102	    private final Map<String, Integer> idempotentCreates = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
